{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792369145,"nonce":"D/jNOPch0vKqQJvrEfNE+M8bOfY=","message":"**First slice landed: be89e01 and 9b74d9c**\n\nOn CodeEditor (and CodeView):\n- `decorate(owner, list, follow = false)`: `CodeDecoration = {from, to, className, ?title, ?wholeLine}`, offsets as `select` takes them; replaces that owner's set, an empty list clears it. A mark per row the range touches, in the content layer behind the text; `wholeLine` paints the full width of each line the range touches. Classes the editor ships: `ui-code-squiggle-error`, `-warning`, `-info` (a wavy line in `--ui-code-error`, `--ui-code-warning`, `--ui-code-info`, drawn as an svg wave) and `ui-code-line-current` (`--ui-code-line-current`); any other class is the app's own CSS.\n- `markers(owner, list, follow = false)`: `CodeMarker = {line, className, ?title}`, zero-based lines; a line the document does not have is left out. Needs `gutterMarkers={true}`, which reserves an 18 px slot left of the line numbers. `ui-code-marker-breakpoint` is a dot in `--ui-code-breakpoint`. `onGutterClick = (line, event) -\u003e ...` is called on a press in that slot on any line, with or without a marker, with the event's button, and the press does not move the caret.\n- `follow`: the set moves with the text. A range's start stays with the text after it, its end does not grow when typing at it, text deleted under a range takes it with it (a whole-line decoration stays); a marker stays with its line (a line break before it moves it down). `decorationsOf(owner)` and `markerLinesOf(owner)` read where they are now; `decorationsAt(offset)` is for a hover's title.\n- Checks in CodeComponents; scene tools/snapshot/scenes/CodeEditorAnnotations.hx.\n\nLeft open in this issue: hover events and position lookup, key hooks, semantic tokens, edits from code as one undo step, caret and selection events. The hover and position lookup are next, as a hints popover.","files":null}]}